---

<section class="py-20 px-6 bg-surface/50" aria-labelledby="method-heading">
	<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
		<header class="text-center mb-16">
			<h2 id="method-heading" class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold text-text-heading mb-6">
				The Method
			</h2>
			<p class="text-xl text-text-body max-w-3xl mx-auto">
				A systematic approach to operational stabilization and forensic analysis.
			</p>
		</header>

		<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
			<!-- Method Overview -->
			<div class="space-y-6">
				<h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-text-heading">
					Information Architecture as Meta-Skill
				</h3>
				<p class="text-text-body leading-relaxed">
					Every operational crisis stems from broken information flows. 
					Payroll errors, compliance failures, inventory discrepancies—these are 
					symptoms of fragmented data architecture. The solution isn't just fixing 
					processes; it's rebuilding the information foundation that makes processes 
					predictable and scalable.
				</p>
				<p class="text-text-body leading-relaxed">
					My methodology combines forensic analysis with systems thinking to identify 
					where information breaks down, then reconstructs the architecture that 
					ensures accuracy, compliance, and operational excellence. This approach has 
					been validated across QSR, hospitality, and professional service environments.
				</p>
				<a 
					href="/methodology" 
					class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-teal hover:text-teal/90 font-medium transition-colors duration-200 min-h-[44px] min-w-[44px] focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal focus:ring-offset-2 focus:ring-offset-bg rounded"
				>
					Explore the Methodology
					<svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
						<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"></path>
					</svg>
				</a>
			</div>

			<!-- Method Pillars -->
			<div class="space-y-6">
				<div class="bg-bg border border-border rounded-lg p-6">
					<h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text-heading mb-3">Forensic Analysis</h4>
					<p class="text-text-body text-sm leading-relaxed">
						Systematic investigation of operational failures to identify root causes 
						and information flow breakdowns. Data-driven diagnosis before prescription.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="bg-bg border border-border rounded-lg p-6">
					<h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text-heading mb-3">Architecture Design</h4>
					<p class="text-text-body text-sm leading-relaxed">
						Rebuilding information systems with proper controls, automation, and 
						scalability. Creating architectures that prevent rather than just detect errors.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="bg-bg border border-border rounded-lg p-6">
					<h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text-heading mb-3">Operational Integration</h4>
					<p class="text-text-body text-sm leading-relaxed">
						Ensuring new systems integrate seamlessly with existing operations while 
						maintaining business continuity and team adoption.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
